L Managers\n     \n     \n     \n\nJoin for FREE or Support the Channel!\n  (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGxtSWEtdVljWlF1WGdrbVlSNVkxNFZXMDUzUXxBQ3Jtc0ttZ3pHdFhyMElrZkx3NEpqQ0RvSzM0NDFLWFZBelZ6V2RqVGx2cGYwSktRQ0tBN3JQeHBkaEU3eFdLOFMxTl9XWUlzZHE4RzY1bXFzTkFvdGU1OEF5Mk01clZZOW1SSnFhYnJKS0FBOVduaHBmV3JjOA\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily\u0026v=Tr7jDYn6mlI)  / fplfamily   (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGxtSWEtdVljWlF1WGdrbVlSNVkxNFZXMDUzUXxBQ3Jtc0ttZ3pHdFhyMElrZkx3NEpqQ0RvSzM0NDFLWFZBelZ6V2RqVGx2cGYwSktRQ0tBN3JQeHBkaEU3eFdLOFMxTl9XWUlzZHE4RzY1bXFzTkFvdGU1OEF5Mk01clZZOW1SSnFhYnJKS0FBOVduaHBmV3JjOA\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily\u0026v=Tr7jDYn6mlI) \n________________________\n 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!\n5162cw\n________________________\n🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!\n  (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEpWUjBiOXR2bjBMbnBIVGpHYlljRy1HalY3Z3xBQ3Jtc0ttUmVROU94SEQwdS1VQWZSSFYyYU1Sb0tOaDVFM2pWS2ZJRDNmeFpWdjBTUGF1cHE3QU44M0VXZnVXRjN3alFuSWw2UWhGOUFsTFhiamxGSWVvdGhiaEI4RXVMTUplVmItenA0TlpoZ3FMaU1iYkplUQ\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fsoundcloud.com%2Ffplfamily\u0026v=Tr7jDYn6mlI)  / fplfamily   (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEpWUjBiOXR2bjBMbnBIVGpHYlljRy1HalY3Z3xBQ3Jtc0ttUmVROU94SEQwdS1VQWZSSFYyYU1Sb0tOaDVFM2pWS2ZJRDNmeFpWdjBTUGF1cHE3QU44M0VXZnVXRjN3alFuSWw2UWhGOUFsTFhiamxGSWVvdGhiaEI4RXVMTUplVmItenA0TlpoZ3FMaU1iYkplUQ\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fsoundcloud.com%2Ffplfamily\u0026v=Tr7jDYn6mlI) \nhttps://audioboom.com/channels/5010221 (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEh1d21BWE5oTjdDU29yRF9Gc2piLTVQenZ6Z3xBQ3Jtc0trS2lxdFI0clJjOVEyNVk1WU5MYjJUR2VkbjR1cDRIV0tIZ1c3bUxVeFNabkVtM0pPRURQUnZSSGNFZ09kdlFlT0JBVXNUX0lTTzA0MjhXdURuZnp0N3dYekJpODV2dWFhTXBNQWlhdXRNelI0Qm1S