Background":4278395197,"additiveBackground":724405217,"textPrimary":4292734717,"textSecondary":4287940340,"invertedBackground":4285707245,"overlayBackground":3422757181},"colorSampledDescriptionBodyText":{"content":"Congratulations to Manchester City - another FA Cup in the bag for Pep Guardiola's men as they pull off a memorable Cup Double. And with three key games still to go this GW, they might yet beat Arsenal to the title to claim a treble. \n\n\nFPL points tough to come by this week, as Dominic Calvert-Lewin wipes out the Brighton clean sheet at the death and Thiago blanks for Brentford - so maybe we should've all just stuck with Watkins and Rogers. Both highly sold before the GW, including by Sam, only for them to punish the sellers with a resounding win against Liverpool.\n\n\nA massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!\n\n\n__________________________\n 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:\n\n\n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW\n     \n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!\n     \n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam\n     \n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers\n     \n     \n     \n\nJoin for FREE or Support the Channel!\n  (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...)  / fplfamily   (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...) \n________________________\n 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!\n5162cw\n________________________\n🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!\n  (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...)  / fplfamily   (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...) \nhttps://audioboom.com/channels/5010221 (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...) \nSearch 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.\n __________________________\nStats, Season Tickers and Player Ratings provided by Fantasy Football Scout Members Area.\nBecome a member here! - http://Bit.ly/FFScoutFamily (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...) \n__________________________   \n 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter, Instagram and TikTok! - Just Search 'fplfamily'\nhttps://www.x.com/fplfamily (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...)  \n  (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...)  / fplfamily   (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...) \nhttps://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even....","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":1112,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAYiEwi3rb3o86uWAxXPjdQCHWQ_F7dI6LfNnf3IwrZ-ygEEXADMyQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGxtSWEtdVljWlF1WGdrbVlSNVkxNFZXMDUzUXxBQ3Jtc0ttZ3pHdFhyMElrZkx3NEpqQ0RvSzM0NDFLWFZBelZ6V2RqVGx2cGYwSktRQ0tBN3JQeHBkaEU3eFdLOFMxTl9XWUlzZHE4RzY1bXFzTkFvdGU1OEF5Mk01clZZOW1SSnFhYnJKS0FBOVduaHBmV3JjOA\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily\u0026v=Tr7jDYn6mlI","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGxtSWEtdVljWlF1WGdrbVlSNVkxNFZXMDUzUXxBQ3Jtc0ttZ3pHdFhyMElrZkx3NEpqQ0RvSzM0NDFLWFZBelZ6V2RqVGx2cGYwSktRQ0tBN3JQeHBkaEU3eFdLOFMxTl9XWUlzZHE4RzY1bXFzTkFvdGU1OEF5Mk01clZZOW1SSnFhYnJKS0FBOVduaHBmV3JjOA\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily\u0026v=Tr7jDYn6mlI","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":1170,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAYiEwi3rb3o86uWAxXPjdQCHWQ_F7dI6LfNnf3IwrZ-ygEEXADMyQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGxtSWEtdVljWlF1WGdrbVlSNVkxNFZXMDUzUXxBQ3Jtc0ttZ3pHdFhyMElrZkx3NEpqQ0RvSzM0NDFLWFZBelZ6V2RqVGx2cGYwSktRQ0tBN3JQeHBkaEU3eFdLOFMxTl9XWUlzZHE4RzY1bXFzTkFvdGU1OEF5Mk01clZZOW1SSnFhYnJKS0FBOVduaHBmV3JjOA\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2